1
00:00:22,799 --> 00:00:26,683
♪The night wind shakes off
the withered leaves♪

2
00:00:29,083 --> 00:00:33,698
♪I open the window and gaze at the moon♪

3
00:00:35,571 --> 00:00:40,709
♪Haze spreads across the river,
lanterns drifting♪

4
00:00:42,047 --> 00:00:47,056
♪I hear the memories rustling♪

5
00:00:48,267 --> 00:00:51,188
♪Garden flowers shed petals one by one♪

6
00:00:51,399 --> 00:00:54,490
♪Candlelight flickers,
swaying with melancholy♪

7
00:00:54,787 --> 00:00:59,022
♪I sigh by the lamp over the long night♪

8
00:01:01,007 --> 00:01:03,915
♪Past memories unfold scene by scene♪

9
00:01:04,213 --> 00:01:07,099
♪It's all your face♪

10
00:01:07,409 --> 00:01:12,191
♪Boldly trampling over my heart♪

11
00:01:12,191 --> 00:01:16,771
♪Two measures of ink I take,
one for love miswritten♪

12
00:01:16,771 --> 00:01:18,770
♪And another for youth passed♪

13
00:01:18,973 --> 00:01:24,755
♪With endless sorrow,
I once traced your silhouette♪

14
00:01:25,139 --> 00:01:29,450
♪Two measures of ink I take,
one for joy and sorrow♪

15
00:01:29,450 --> 00:01:31,958
♪And another for parting and reunion♪

16
00:01:32,204 --> 00:01:42,421
♪I write until splendor fades,
and I am no more♪

17
00:01:45,871 --> 00:01:48,705
=Prelude of the White Snake=

18
00:01:48,705 --> 00:01:51,623
=Episode 18=

19
00:02:11,360 --> 00:02:12,360
Xu Xian?

20
00:02:14,080 --> 00:02:15,080
Xu Xian?

21
00:02:17,240 --> 00:02:18,879
Xu Xian, what's wrong?

22
00:02:23,400 --> 00:02:24,400
Xu Xian?

23
00:02:29,120 --> 00:02:30,120
What is this?

24
00:02:42,080 --> 00:02:44,560
Why would he have
such a dangerous artifact?

25
00:02:51,919 --> 00:02:53,120
It's the Du'e Ancient Scroll.

26
00:02:53,879 --> 00:02:56,039
Master Hanshan passed it on to me.

27
00:02:57,360 --> 00:02:58,759
What is the Du'e Ancient Scroll?

28
00:03:00,080 --> 00:03:02,520
The Du'e Ancient Scroll
is an ancient artifact.

29
00:03:03,120 --> 00:03:04,879
It possesses the purest energy

30
00:03:05,280 --> 00:03:06,520
and can redeem demons.

31
00:03:07,800 --> 00:03:08,800
Redeem demons?

32
00:03:09,199 --> 00:03:10,240
Using your body?

33
00:03:10,740 --> 00:03:13,169
(True, fake)

34
00:03:14,360 --> 00:03:15,360
What?

35
00:03:15,759 --> 00:03:17,680
You saw Bai Suzhen
cast a spell to save you?

36
00:03:19,400 --> 00:03:20,400
Yes.

37
00:03:20,879 --> 00:03:22,759
I told her about
the Du'e Ancient Scroll before,

38
00:03:23,800 --> 00:03:25,199
but she seemed not to remember.

39
00:03:32,199 --> 00:03:34,599
Besides, I feel she's been acting
very strange lately.

40
00:03:37,919 --> 00:03:38,919
What do you mean?

41
00:03:41,240 --> 00:03:42,240
Have you ever suspected

42
00:03:42,719 --> 00:03:44,159
that Suzhen isn't really Suzhen?

43
00:03:45,680 --> 00:03:48,240
Suzhen isn't Suzhen?

44
00:03:50,759 --> 00:03:52,080
Besides the Du'e Ancient Scroll,

45
00:03:52,080 --> 00:03:53,319
do you have other suspicions?

46
00:03:56,039 --> 00:03:58,400
I suspect she's the one
behind Changming.

47
00:03:59,599 --> 00:04:00,599
Or

48
00:04:01,840 --> 00:04:03,000
she might even be a demon.

49
00:04:05,919 --> 00:04:06,919
A demon?

50
00:04:09,360 --> 00:04:10,400
No. Absolutely impossible.

51
00:04:11,199 --> 00:04:12,560
How could Suzhen be a demon?

52
00:04:17,199 --> 00:04:18,279
Why are you so worked up?

53
00:04:18,959 --> 00:04:20,959
I'm suspecting
the person controlling her.

54
00:04:23,399 --> 00:04:24,759
Go on. Keep going.

55
00:04:27,759 --> 00:04:28,759
I have two theories.

56
00:04:29,560 --> 00:04:32,399
First, Suzhen might be possessed
by a demon.

57
00:04:32,879 --> 00:04:36,879
Second, Suzhen never made it
out of the mural world,

58
00:04:38,040 --> 00:04:41,639
and the one here now
is the mastermind behind Changming,

59
00:04:42,040 --> 00:04:43,240
disguised as Suzhen.

60
00:04:47,199 --> 00:04:48,199
How could that be?

61
00:04:48,519 --> 00:04:50,399
I know Suzhen's aura better than anyone.

62
00:04:50,839 --> 00:04:52,920
How could I not recognize her?

63
00:04:53,600 --> 00:04:54,600
Aura?

64
00:05:00,439 --> 00:05:02,720
But if you put it that way,

65
00:05:03,279 --> 00:05:04,959
she really has been
acting strange lately.

66
00:05:10,879 --> 00:05:11,879
It's good.

67
00:05:13,920 --> 00:05:14,920
Absolutely good.

68
00:05:16,120 --> 00:05:19,079
After over five centuries of cultivation

69
00:05:19,480 --> 00:05:22,160
and finally a chance
to achieve immortality,

70
00:05:22,639 --> 00:05:24,680
do you think it matters to me or not?

71
00:05:28,000 --> 00:05:29,000
Thinking back carefully,

72
00:05:29,720 --> 00:05:33,199
she's been a bit off
since the day she came out.

73
00:05:42,920 --> 00:05:44,399
It's not like I'm naked.

74
00:05:45,160 --> 00:05:46,519
You need not be so nervous.

75
00:05:49,879 --> 00:05:50,879
Young Master Xu,

76
00:05:52,240 --> 00:05:53,240
what is this?

77
00:05:58,959 --> 00:06:00,800
Suzhen, let's play together for a bit.

78
00:06:02,480 --> 00:06:04,720
Qing, I have things to do right now.

79
00:06:05,199 --> 00:06:06,199
I'll play with you

80
00:06:06,199 --> 00:06:07,399
when I have time, alright?

81
00:06:07,680 --> 00:06:11,920
Suzhen, just play with me
for a little while, please?

82
00:06:11,920 --> 00:06:12,920
Qing.

83
00:06:13,600 --> 00:06:14,920
Could you stop bothering me?

84
00:06:18,600 --> 00:06:19,600
Look,

85
00:06:20,040 --> 00:06:22,160
if our guess is right,

86
00:06:24,040 --> 00:06:25,040
then the Suzhen now

87
00:06:26,079 --> 00:06:27,839
really might not be Suzhen.

88
00:06:30,120 --> 00:06:31,959
That's why we need to find a way

89
00:06:32,199 --> 00:06:33,600
to test the Suzhen now.

90
00:06:35,120 --> 00:06:36,240
What kind of way?

91
00:06:38,079 --> 00:06:41,279
That's why I came
to discuss it with you.

92
00:06:46,879 --> 00:06:47,879
Come here.

93
00:06:49,759 --> 00:06:51,680
Jinshan Temple has a medicine.

94
00:06:52,199 --> 00:06:53,439
As long as a demon takes it,

95
00:06:53,439 --> 00:06:55,120
it will reveal their true form.

96
00:06:55,399 --> 00:06:56,600
It's worth a try.

97
00:06:58,160 --> 00:07:01,639
How dare you talk such nonsense here!

98
00:07:01,959 --> 00:07:03,199
What if she really is Suzhen?

99
00:07:04,680 --> 00:07:06,160
If she is, no harm will be done.

100
00:07:07,720 --> 00:07:08,720
You want a beating?

101
00:07:12,040 --> 00:07:13,199
Are you hiding something?

102
00:07:14,120 --> 00:07:16,199
No, not at all.

103
00:07:18,040 --> 00:07:19,040
No.

104
00:07:19,160 --> 00:07:20,160
Out with it.

105
00:07:20,160 --> 00:07:21,240
Really, no. I...

106
00:07:21,959 --> 00:07:22,959
Are you talking or not?

107
00:07:23,399 --> 00:07:24,560
Monks do not lie.

108
00:07:30,720 --> 00:07:33,639
Right, if this person
really can control Suzhen,

109
00:07:33,639 --> 00:07:34,639
- then she...
- I know.

110
00:07:35,000 --> 00:07:36,000
Stop the secret gestures.

111
00:07:36,800 --> 00:07:39,040
Fahai, tell me.

112
00:07:46,160 --> 00:07:48,319
Whatever! So be it!

113
00:07:51,839 --> 00:07:52,839
They're demons.

114
00:08:04,000 --> 00:08:05,000
How is that possible?

115
00:08:05,000 --> 00:08:06,199
If they were demons, I'd know.

116
00:08:15,319 --> 00:08:16,319
What kind of demons?

117
00:08:25,240 --> 00:08:26,240
Snake demons.

118
00:08:41,200 --> 00:08:43,399
Are they the snake demons

119
00:08:45,120 --> 00:08:46,240
who killed my parents?

120
00:08:48,720 --> 00:08:49,919
Don't jump to conclusions.

121
00:08:50,440 --> 00:08:52,279
It might not be what you think.

122
00:09:10,440 --> 00:09:11,440
What?

123
00:09:12,039 --> 00:09:13,240
Still won't give up?

124
00:09:14,639 --> 00:09:16,879
I made this cage specially for you.

125
00:09:18,039 --> 00:09:19,399
Haven't you gotten used to it?

126
00:09:21,120 --> 00:09:22,120
You won't succeed.

127
00:09:22,600 --> 00:09:24,360
Xu Xian will figure it out
sooner or later.

128
00:09:27,919 --> 00:09:29,799
Haven't you seen how they've treated me

129
00:09:30,240 --> 00:09:31,679
these past days?

130
00:09:32,879 --> 00:09:34,200
A fake is always a fake.

131
00:09:35,279 --> 00:09:36,279
Fake?

132
00:09:37,679 --> 00:09:38,679
Don't forget,

133
00:09:39,759 --> 00:09:41,720
you and I have always been one.

134
00:09:42,240 --> 00:09:43,919
I could never do the evil you've done.

135
00:09:43,919 --> 00:09:46,120
Shut up! What is good, and what is evil?

136
00:09:47,559 --> 00:09:49,879
Why are you good and I am evil?

137
00:09:50,240 --> 00:09:52,000
Why can't I become
an immortal in your place?

138
00:10:00,200 --> 00:10:01,559
That's how it is.

139
00:10:02,480 --> 00:10:03,480
Just calm down a bit.

140
00:10:05,120 --> 00:10:07,039
What if she's just using me to ascend?

141
00:10:08,159 --> 00:10:09,399
What do you mean, "using you"?

142
00:10:09,960 --> 00:10:10,960
Don't you know

143
00:10:10,960 --> 00:10:11,960
whether Suzhen loves you?

144
00:10:12,519 --> 00:10:14,159
Besides, she never lied to you.

145
00:10:14,519 --> 00:10:16,159
She never told you she was human.

146
00:10:16,399 --> 00:10:18,440
Your own lack of skill
kept you in the dark.

147
00:10:18,440 --> 00:10:19,440
Just keep quiet.

148
00:10:19,799 --> 00:10:20,799
Am I wrong?

149
00:10:21,759 --> 00:10:23,200
If Suzhen killed his parents,

150
00:10:23,519 --> 00:10:25,120
why would the Goddess send her?

151
00:10:25,600 --> 00:10:26,600
Use your head.

152
00:10:27,000 --> 00:10:28,000
You're so stupid.

153
00:10:33,559 --> 00:10:35,440
Miss Qing is right.

154
00:10:37,080 --> 00:10:39,639
Right now, Miss Bai has lost
a part of her memory.

155
00:10:40,759 --> 00:10:43,240
Our top priority now
is to rescue Miss Bai

156
00:10:43,240 --> 00:10:44,600
and help her regain her memory,

157
00:10:45,279 --> 00:10:46,919
and then the truth will come out.

158
00:10:51,279 --> 00:10:53,279
Even I trust Miss Bai's character.

159
00:10:54,120 --> 00:10:55,440
You have been together so long.

160
00:10:57,600 --> 00:10:58,840
Do you still doubt her?

161
00:11:03,559 --> 00:11:04,600
Will you save Suzhen or not?

162
00:11:04,600 --> 00:11:05,600
Wait, sit down first.

163
00:11:05,639 --> 00:11:06,639
Just calm down.

164
00:11:07,039 --> 00:11:08,039
If you won't, I'll do it.

165
00:11:08,240 --> 00:11:09,240
Come back.

166
00:11:09,320 --> 00:11:10,320
Wait.

167
00:11:14,519 --> 00:11:16,799
Why the rush? Do you even have a plan?

168
00:11:19,799 --> 00:11:20,799
Do you have one?

169
00:11:24,320 --> 00:11:25,440
You imprisoned these demons

170
00:11:25,440 --> 00:11:28,080
in this mural world
and absorbed their demonic energy

171
00:11:28,080 --> 00:11:29,080
for your own use,

172
00:11:30,360 --> 00:11:31,600
destroying their foundation.

173
00:11:32,480 --> 00:11:35,120
Isn't what you've done pure evil?

174
00:11:40,879 --> 00:11:43,720
I've given them a world
where demons reign supreme.

175
00:11:44,360 --> 00:11:45,840
When thirsty, they can drink.

176
00:11:46,360 --> 00:11:47,519
When hungry, they can eat.

177
00:11:47,840 --> 00:11:49,399
No longer hunted by demon hunters,

178
00:11:49,399 --> 00:11:51,159
nor despised by the immortals.

179
00:11:52,000 --> 00:11:55,600
How am I not doing good for them?

180
00:11:57,000 --> 00:11:58,919
But you're draining
their demonic energy.

181
00:12:00,639 --> 00:12:02,320
I've given them so much.

182
00:12:02,519 --> 00:12:04,279
Of course they should repay me a bit.

183
00:12:05,799 --> 00:12:06,799
What?

184
00:12:07,159 --> 00:12:09,919
Does your idea of good

185
00:12:10,279 --> 00:12:11,799
mean expecting nothing in return?

186
00:12:12,919 --> 00:12:14,759
I've never sought anything in return.

187
00:12:15,720 --> 00:12:16,720
The good I cultivate

188
00:12:17,000 --> 00:12:18,080
is to protect the weak

189
00:12:18,480 --> 00:12:19,480
and shelter all life.

190
00:12:20,519 --> 00:12:21,679
Your so-called "good"

191
00:12:22,200 --> 00:12:23,440
is just the good fruit

192
00:12:23,440 --> 00:12:24,440
born from my good deeds.

193
00:12:30,759 --> 00:12:32,000
Such self-righteousness

194
00:12:32,000 --> 00:12:33,000
and sophistry!

195
00:12:34,600 --> 00:12:37,879
This is a world where the strong
prey on the weak.

196
00:12:38,840 --> 00:12:42,000
Your good is nothing
but a lie made up by the weak

197
00:12:42,000 --> 00:12:44,039
to deceive themselves.

198
00:12:47,559 --> 00:12:48,720
You twist cause and effect

199
00:12:49,080 --> 00:12:50,080
and call wrong right.

200
00:12:50,360 --> 00:12:51,360
Your evil desire

201
00:12:51,720 --> 00:12:53,559
places yourself above all else,

202
00:12:53,960 --> 00:12:56,720
but all living things in this world
are meant to be equal.

203
00:12:58,200 --> 00:12:59,480
Equal?

204
00:13:00,559 --> 00:13:03,240
They're merely nourishment
for me to absorb.

205
00:13:09,639 --> 00:13:11,039
You'll understand sooner or later

206
00:13:12,080 --> 00:13:13,679
that everything you do now

207
00:13:14,600 --> 00:13:18,279
will inevitably turn back
on you in another way.

208
00:13:20,519 --> 00:13:21,519
Turn back?

209
00:13:22,519 --> 00:13:24,559
The strong never fear such a thing.

210
00:13:25,240 --> 00:13:27,480
They only care
about controlling the present.

211
00:13:28,960 --> 00:13:30,120
Just like you.

212
00:13:31,120 --> 00:13:33,200
I keep absorbing your demonic energy,

213
00:13:33,679 --> 00:13:35,600
while you grow weaker and weaker.

214
00:13:36,679 --> 00:13:37,679
Tell me,

215
00:13:38,039 --> 00:13:40,159
how could that possibly turn back on me?

216
00:13:47,720 --> 00:13:48,720
Suzhen.

217
00:13:52,360 --> 00:13:54,159
(I know Suzhen's aura
better than anyone.)

218
00:13:54,480 --> 00:13:56,320
(How could I not recognize her?)

219
00:13:57,200 --> 00:13:58,919
(That's why we need to find a way)

220
00:13:59,320 --> 00:14:00,480
(to test the Suzhen now.)

221
00:14:02,399 --> 00:14:03,399
Mark my words.

222
00:14:05,120 --> 00:14:07,919
I will replace you sooner or later.

223
00:14:26,000 --> 00:14:27,000
May I come in?

224
00:14:27,440 --> 00:14:28,440
Of course.

225
00:14:37,360 --> 00:14:38,360
Suzhen,

226
00:14:38,759 --> 00:14:39,879
about our wedding,

227
00:14:40,399 --> 00:14:42,840
I'd like to talk to you about it again.

228
00:14:43,000 --> 00:14:44,000
Any day works for me.

229
00:14:44,080 --> 00:14:45,080
The sooner, the better.

230
00:14:45,159 --> 00:14:46,279
No need for anything fancy.

231
00:14:46,639 --> 00:14:47,639
A simple wedding is fine.

232
00:14:50,039 --> 00:14:51,039
I know you're excited,

233
00:14:51,519 --> 00:14:54,639
but I'd still like
to postpone the wedding.

234
00:14:58,279 --> 00:14:59,279
Why?

235
00:14:59,279 --> 00:15:00,720
Did I do something wrong?

236
00:15:03,399 --> 00:15:04,399
Of course not.

237
00:15:05,639 --> 00:15:06,639
You're wonderful.

238
00:15:06,720 --> 00:15:07,879
How could it be your fault?

239
00:15:08,519 --> 00:15:09,639
I must avenge my parents.

240
00:15:12,879 --> 00:15:14,200
I can't rush into settling

241
00:15:14,200 --> 00:15:16,240
our future with a clear conscience.

242
00:15:18,679 --> 00:15:19,679
I don't care about that.

243
00:15:21,399 --> 00:15:22,399
But I do.

244
00:15:25,679 --> 00:15:27,159
If you can never get your revenge,

245
00:15:27,360 --> 00:15:29,159
do you intend never to marry me?

246
00:15:32,120 --> 00:15:33,120
Yes.

247
00:16:07,720 --> 00:16:09,960
Then why not marry me first?

248
00:16:10,639 --> 00:16:12,960
I can help you get your revenge.
How about that?

249
00:16:13,840 --> 00:16:16,120
No, I can't hold you back.

250
00:16:47,749 --> 00:16:51,908
♪I also gave my youth to someone♪

251
00:16:54,375 --> 00:16:58,753
♪I must admit, you made the journey♪

252
00:17:00,296 --> 00:17:06,121
♪When loving you
became instinct, what's left♪

253
00:17:06,890 --> 00:17:11,357
♪Seals a fate too brutal to amend♪

254
00:17:14,222 --> 00:17:18,663
♪Clumsy and new, we gave our first kiss♪

255
00:17:20,859 --> 00:17:25,589
♪Never thought passionate eyes
would turn cold♪

256
00:17:26,801 --> 00:17:32,914
♪I thought of pulling away,
but I'd barely begun♪

257
00:17:33,577 --> 00:17:39,359
♪Having loved you so deep,
how could I love another♪

258
00:17:39,359 --> 00:17:45,622
♪Even if we're strangers again,
why deny we loved♪

259
00:17:45,932 --> 00:17:52,291
♪Though I'm stubborn,
I never stopped you from loving others♪

260
00:17:52,462 --> 00:17:59,829
♪I shouldn't have been so foolish
to think there was still hope♪

261
00:18:00,114 --> 00:18:05,661
♪But you won't even admit what we had♪

262
00:18:06,152 --> 00:18:12,362
♪Even if we're strangers again,
why deny we loved♪

263
00:18:12,672 --> 00:18:19,445
♪Though I have questions,
I never questioned you♪

264
00:18:20,442 --> 00:18:26,095
♪I'll lock you away and set myself free♪

265
00:18:26,929 --> 00:18:31,337
♪After all, I'm the one you deny♪

266
00:18:32,102 --> 00:18:34,690
♪Having ever loved♪
